Kind: ablation
Issue: #662
Takes out: the step #662 adds to the four creating traps -- mach_port_deallocate(current_space(), name) on the copyout-failure path -- so a creation whose name cannot be copied out leaves the send right in the caller's space under a name it was never told, as before the fix. act_test [16] aims the OUT name at a VM_PROT_NONE page, counts the space's names with mach_port_names() before and after, and finds names left behind.
Run: --entry 14 1200 -smp 1
Expect: name\(s\) left behind after creations whose name could not be copied out
